---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Create([run create])
    Creating[Run creating]
    Seed[Seed pending database placements]
    SeedGuard{Every placement seeded?}
    Activate[Create cursors; retain frozen membership hash; delete temporary plan]
    Pending[Run pending]
    DispatchGuard{Pending or running with open shard cursor?}
    DispatchLock[Claim one run-shard dispatch cursor]
    Running[Run running]
    DispatchEvents[Insert run.started once and one chunk-ready outbox record per selected chunk]
    DispatchCursor[Mark selected chunks dispatched and release or mark cursor drained]

    FinalizeGuard{Drained cursors and every planned shard sealed?}
    Finalizing[Run finalizing]
    Scorecard[Merge retained results and planned gate denominators]
    FinalizeCheck{Current lease and exact sealed membership?}
    Gate{Gate outcome}
    CompletedPass[Run completed + gate pass]
    CompletedFail[Run completed + gate fail]
    CompletedEvent[Insert run.completed event]

    CancelGuard{Cancelable status?}
    CancelCascade[Cancel open chunks, executions, and attempts]
    Cancelled[Run cancelled + gate fail]
    CancelEvent[Insert run.cancelled event]

    Failed[Run failed]
    Noop[No transition]
    Reject([Cancellation error])

    Create --> Creating
    Creating --> Seed --> SeedGuard
    SeedGuard -- Yes --> Activate --> Pending
    SeedGuard -- Retryable failure --> Creating
    SeedGuard -- Persisted-data conflict --> Failed

    Pending --> DispatchGuard
    DispatchGuard -- Yes --> DispatchLock --> Running --> DispatchEvents --> DispatchCursor
    DispatchGuard -- No --> Noop

    Running --> FinalizeGuard
    FinalizeGuard -- Yes --> Finalizing
    FinalizeGuard -- No --> Noop

    Finalizing --> FinalizeCheck
    FinalizeCheck -- Yes --> Scorecard --> Gate
    FinalizeCheck -- No --> Noop

    Gate -- Criteria met --> CompletedPass --> CompletedEvent
    Gate -- Evaluation failure or incomplete results --> CompletedFail --> CompletedEvent

    Pending --> CancelGuard
    Running --> CancelGuard
    Finalizing --> CancelGuard
    CancelGuard -- Pending running or finalizing --> CancelCascade --> Cancelled --> CancelEvent
    CancelGuard -- Completed or failed --> Reject
    Cancelled -->|Repeated cancel| Noop

    Running -. Unrecoverable system error .-> Failed

    class Create command
    class Creating,Seed,SeedGuard,Activate,Pending,Running,Finalizing,DispatchGuard,DispatchLock,DispatchEvents,DispatchCursor,FinalizeGuard,FinalizeCheck,Scorecard,Gate,CompletedEvent,CancelGuard,CancelCascade,CancelEvent system
    class CompletedPass success
    class CompletedFail,Cancelled,Failed,Reject error
    class Noop component
